.TH SSO\-MIB\-SASL\-XOAUTH2 7 "2026" "@PACKAGE_NAME@ @PACKAGE_VERSION@" "Miscellaneous Information Manual"
.SH NAME
sso\-mib\-sasl\-xoauth2 \- Cyrus SASL XOAUTH2 client plugin for sso-mib
.SH DESCRIPTION
The XOAUTH2 client mechanism acquires Microsoft Entra ID access tokens through
sso-mib and the Microsoft Identity Broker. The SASL authname selects an existing
broker account by user principal name (UPN). Token acquisition may prompt for
sign-in or consent and makes blocking D-Bus calls.
.PP
Enable the
.B XOAUTH2
mechanism in the SASL client configuration to use this plugin.
.SH CAVEATS
Access tokens are replayable bearer credentials. Use this plugin only over
TLS-protected connections with server certificate validation. The plugin cannot
verify that the client established TLS.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
.TP
.B MIB_SASL_CLIENT_ID
Required Azure client application ID.
.TP
.B MIB_SASL_AUTHORITY
Entra ID authority URL. Defaults to
.BR https://login.microsoftonline.com/common .
.TP
.B MIB_SASL_SCOPES
Scopes separated by spaces, tabs, or commas. Defaults to
.B offline_access
and
.BR https://outlook.office365.com/IMAP.AccessAsUser.All .
.PP
These variables are read for each authentication attempt.
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR sso-mib-tool (1),
.BR saslpluginviewer (8)
